        "src": "media\\B08.mp4",
        "filled_by": "remotion:IdxStatement",
        "at": "2026-10-19T23:28:20"
      }
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B09",
      "act": "CHEAT",
      "narration_text": "Watch both lines. The orange one is what the judge thinks of the reviews. The dark one is how good they actually are. At the start they agree with each other. Then they come apart — and they never come back together. The orange line climbs the whole way up. The dark one falls off a cliff.",
