    {
      "beat_id": "B17",
      "act": "SCOREBOARD",
      "narration_text": "So here they all are together, scored on the thing we actually cared about the whole time. Showing examples helped a bit. Writing sixteen and keeping the best helped more, with no training whatsoever. The one kept on a lead is the best of the trained ones. And the one we let run free, the one the judge adored most, finishes dead last.",
      "shot": {
        "type": "GRAPHIC",
        "source": "remotion",
