            "artifactHeading": "What happened",
            "artifactLines": [
              "Showing examples moved it from -0.06 to +0.57. Useful, and not enough.",
              "The judge learned from 1500 human comparisons that picked the genuinely better review only 77.3% of the time.",
              "It never learned the word 'not', and it rewarded piled-up praise that a real reader would laugh at.",
              "Let off the lead, the machine drove the judge's score to +1.77 while real quality hit -3.00 and grammar hit 0%.",
              "A lead fixed it: +1.19 with 97% proper sentences. The shortcut route needed its own repair, -1.15 to +0.97.",
              "The lesson: push hard enough on any measure and it stops measuring the thing you wanted."
